 "description": "Use this when the user asks about delays, closures or weather at an airport, such as \"is JFK delayed?\" or \"what is the weather at Heathrow?\". Pass the IATA code (JFK) or the ICAO code (EGLL). Returns active FAA delays, ground stops and closures for US airports with the reason and times, and the latest METAR observation (flight category, temperature, wind, visibility) and raw TAF forecast from the Aviation Weather Center. FAA delay data covers US airports only; for airports elsewhere only the weather is returned. For general information, not flight planning.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "airport": {
    "description": "IATA code such as \"JFK\" or ICAO code such as \"EGLL\"",
    "pattern": "^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9]{2,3}$",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "airport"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
 "name": "get_airport_status",
